  - m_Id: 290981939228672
    m_Localized: Hints
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306994005127168
    m_Localized: Picnic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306994009321472
    m_Localized: Cozy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306994009321473
    m_Localized: Cloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941037174784
    m_Localized: LEARN TO PLAY  {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923520
    m_Localized: Skip tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923521
    m_Localized: Match the yarn!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923522
    m_Localized: 'Each cat needs yarn of its own color. Tap this cat: the path in
      front of it is clear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923523
    m_Localized: The way is clear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923524
    m_Localized: Tap this cat now. At the baskets, cats swap yarn automatically.
      Matching all their yarn lets them leave!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923525
    m_Localized: Make room first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923526
    m_Localized: Only 2 cats fit on the track. Tap this cat first to open the path
      for the cat behind it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923527
    m_Localized: Choose the right color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923528
    m_Localized: Tap this cat to collect matching yarn. Sending two cats of the same
      color can fill the track and block progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923529
    m_Localized: Send the last cat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923530
    m_Localized: A track space is free! Tap the last cat. Clear every cat to complete
      the level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923531
    m_Localized: Watch the baskets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923532
    m_Localized: Cats leave other colors at the baskets and pick up their own color.
      Wait for a free path and track space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384860758016
    m_Localized: Two places on the track
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952320
    m_Localized: Only 2 cats fit on the track. Tap this cat to send it to the baskets
      and collect yarn of its own color.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952321
    m_Localized: Cats leave yarn of other colors in the baskets and pick up their
      own color. A cat leaves once all its yarn matches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952322
    m_Localized: Continue tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952323
    m_Localized: Waiting for track space...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731804307456
    m_Localized: Read the track counter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501760
    m_Localized: 0/2 means no cats on the track, out of 2 allowed. The number on
      the right is the limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501761
    m_Localized: These are the baskets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501762
    m_Localized: Here, cats leave other colors and collect their own. A cat leaves
      the track once all its yarn matches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501763
    m_Localized: Help the other cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501764
    m_Localized: Now send this cat to collect its own color. Clear every cat to finish
      the level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501765
    m_Localized: Let's try an example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501766
    m_Localized: Send this green cat. We'll try filling both places with green cats
      to see what happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501767
    m_Localized: Fill the second place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501768
    m_Localized: Send the other green cat too. Both track places will be occupied,
      leaving the blue cat here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501769
    m_Localized: Watch the cats...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501770
    m_Localized: Now the track is stuck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501771
    m_Localized: Both places are taken by green cats. They need the green yarn on
      the blue cat, but it cannot enter. Let's restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501772
    m_Localized: Restart this level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501773
    m_Localized: Tap Restart. Then we'll try an order that frees the track.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501774
    m_Localized: Try a different order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501775
    m_Localized: Start with this green cat. This time, keep the second track place
      for the blue cat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501776
    m_Localized: Now send the blue cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501777
    m_Localized: The blue cat carries green yarn and needs blue yarn. Sending different
      colors lets both cats get what they need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2160169884561408
    m_Localized: The track is full
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2160169892950016
    m_Localized: '2/2: both places are occupied. Another cat can enter only after
      a cat on the track collects all its yarn and leaves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2166080854274048
    m_Localized: The green cats need green yarn, but the basket holds blue yarn.
      Their yarn is on the blue cat, which cannot enter the full track. Let's restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2166080854274049
    m_Localized: Open Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2166080854274050
    m_Localized: Tap the gear. The Restart button is inside Settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2173509885210624
    m_Localized: The green cat needs green yarn to leave the track. Send the blue
      cat carrying that yarn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2178074089074688
    m_Localized: Need a hint?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2178074093268992
    m_Localized: Tap the light bulb to highlight a cat you can send next. Use it
      whenever you need help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2178074093268993
    m_Localized: The light bulb highlights a cat you can send next. Hints are off;
      you can turn them on in Settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
